    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "FLY\nSOUTHWEST\nAIRLINES®\nOctober 29, 1989 Flight Schedule\nThe\nCompany\nPlane:\nis on call.\nNew Signals\nOf Success",
      "SOUTHWEST\nAIRLINES\nFLY\nPacific\nOakland\nSan Francisc\nLas Vegas\nLos Angeles\n(LAX)\n*Ontario\nPhoenix\nSan Diego\nMountain\nAlbuquerque\nEl Pasc\nCentral\nChicago\nMidway\nEastern\nDetroit\nIndianapoli:\nOklahoma\nCity\nAmarillo\nLubbock\nMidland\nOdessa\nSan Antonio\nCorpus\nChristi\nKansas City\nSt. Louis\nLittle Rock\nDallas\n(Love Field),\nAustin/\nHouston\n(Hobby \u0026 Intercontinental)\nRio Grande Valley\n(Harlingen/South Padre Island)\nNashville,\nBirminghan\nNew Orleans\n(City \u0026 Metro)\nIf you fly frequently on Southwest Airlines,\nplease send us your name and address and we\nwill place you on our mailing list. Mail\nrequests to: Southwest Airlines Schedule List\nP.O. Box 650331\nDallas, TX 75265-0331\n© 1989 Southwest Airlines\nAll other correspondence should be sent to:\nSouthwest Airlines Co.\nP.O. Box 37611\nDallas, TX 75235"
    ],
